18:22.502 --> 18:27.174
The rice has corn in it.
I just can't.

18:27.174 --> 18:28.175
I fuck with
the yellow rice, okay?

18:28.175 --> 18:29.842
Uh, points for the idea.

18:29.842 --> 18:32.345
This shit is gross.

18:32.345 --> 18:34.714
It's gross, man.

18:34.714 --> 18:36.349
That chef over there
is making sushi rolls

18:36.349 --> 18:38.050
with his bare-ass hands, Earn.

18:38.050 --> 18:40.787
♪ Or one of us will leave here
tonight in a hearse ♪

18:40.787 --> 18:42.789
♪ When we'll be tried by 12
and fertilizing daisies... ♪

18:42.789 --> 18:45.792
Yeah, the fish is raw,
but it's warm.

18:45.792 --> 18:47.894
Like, I feel like
that can't be safe.

18:47.894 --> 18:49.529
Can we please...
can we just please

18:49.529 --> 18:52.299
just go across the street, man,
get lunch real quick,

18:52.299 --> 18:53.800
and stop lying
to these Black folk?

18:53.800 --> 18:57.136
It's a Black sushi
fusion restaurant, okay?

18:57.136 --> 19:00.873
There's gonna be a couple of
new ideas thrown at you, okay?

19:00.873 --> 19:03.710
Can we please
keep our minds open?

19:03.710 --> 19:06.646
Could I interest you on a refill
of, uh, hot white Hennessy?

19:06.646 --> 19:08.715
♪ 'Cause I'd rather be
tried by 12... ♪

19:08.715 --> 19:10.717
I need, I need, I need, uh,
I need the bathroom, man.

19:10.717 --> 19:12.552
- Yeah, yeah, I gotcha.
- Uh, uh, got me on that?

19:12.552 --> 19:14.887
All right. Cool. I'm-a just...
I'm-a run to the bathroom.

19:14.887 --> 19:17.224
So we might catch a body... ♪

19:17.224 --> 19:19.559
- Hey.
- Be careful.

19:19.559 --> 19:20.827
- You got it, man?
- Hey, I'm good, man. I'm good.

19:20.827 --> 19:22.229
All right.

19:34.006 --> 19:36.075
Oh.

19:51.924 --> 19:53.960
Hey, man.

19:53.960 --> 19:56.629
Yo. What are you doing here?

19:56.629 --> 19:58.531
Uh, I just was
in the neighborhood,

19:58.531 --> 20:00.700
and, um, thought I'd come by.

20:00.700 --> 20:02.769
You lying.

20:06.005 --> 20:07.540
- Hey.
- Come on.

20:07.540 --> 20:08.975
- What's up, man?
- What's up?

20:08.975 --> 20:10.977
- Is it okay if I hug you?
- Of course, man.

20:10.977 --> 20:13.212
- All right.
- Can't get no sicker.

20:13.212 --> 20:14.647
All right.

20:14.647 --> 20:16.816
- Come in, bro.
- Yo.

20:16.816 --> 20:19.486
- Ugh.
- I was just, um...

20:19.486 --> 20:21.354
Got something for you.

20:22.522 --> 20:24.491
You know they deliver, right?

20:24.491 --> 20:26.993
Yeah. I mean,
I got the app on my phone,

20:26.993 --> 20:29.629
lets me know, so I just thought
I'd help you out.

20:29.629 --> 20:32.999
- Ah. Well, that's nice.
- Yeah, well...

20:32.999 --> 20:36.469
- Oh, come have this jollof.
- Yeah. Uh...

20:36.469 --> 20:38.805
Wait. Wait. Who made jollof?

20:38.805 --> 20:40.340
My roommate, bro.

20:40.340 --> 20:41.808
Who the hell
you think made it?

20:41.808 --> 20:43.175
Like, come on.

20:45.144 --> 20:49.148
Um, I can't really
have any right now,

20:49.148 --> 20:51.318
'cause I'm about to go meet up
with some people,

20:51.318 --> 20:52.819
get some food, so...

20:52.819 --> 20:55.355
Wait, you're not staying?

20:58.325 --> 21:01.661
I'm kidding.
It's cool. Don't worry about it.

21:03.596 --> 21:05.365
I mean, I'll stay
if you want me to.

21:05.365 --> 21:09.669
Oh, boy, I don't want you
in here. I want you out there.

21:09.669 --> 21:12.505
Have fun. Go see your people.

21:12.505 --> 21:14.607
Great. Now I got the picture...

21:14.607 --> 21:19.178
I'll take half a bowl of jollof.

21:21.180 --> 21:23.950
Okay. I'm gonna get you
a full bowl.

21:23.950 --> 21:26.786
- Just eat half.
- Okay. Thank you.

21:26.786 --> 21:28.521
What else do you want?

21:50.910 --> 21:53.279
I miss you, man.

21:54.614 --> 21:56.282
Miss you.

21:58.918 --> 22:00.453
How's Mom?

22:06.826 --> 22:08.595
What about Dad?

22:11.398 --> 22:13.299
Yeah.

22:20.139 --> 22:23.342
...to get
a check cut and sent to us.

22:23.342 --> 22:25.845
Pay your son's bills.
The case is dismissed.

22:25.845 --> 22:28.347
They sound like very nice
people to me. Outrageous.

22:31.017 --> 22:32.485
Whoa.

22:35.154 --> 22:37.524
Damn.

22:42.128 --> 22:44.697
Are you okay?

22:44.697 --> 22:47.133
Hey, I thought you said I
couldn't turn over in here, man.

22:47.133 --> 22:49.301
I-I've never seen that before.

22:50.269 --> 22:52.304
Wait.

22:52.304 --> 22:54.641
How long was I asleep?

22:54.641 --> 22:57.109
I-I don't know.
About 30 minoots?

22:57.109 --> 22:58.878
Maybe 35.

22:58.878 --> 23:00.312
Wait. Wait. What?

23:00.312 --> 23:02.949
30 minoo...!

23:23.736 --> 23:25.738
You were gone for a while, man.

23:25.738 --> 23:27.173
Yeah, man. That's 'cause, uh,

23:27.173 --> 23:28.675
the bathroom was in the Rainbow
across the street.

23:28.675 --> 23:30.342
Damn.

23:30.342 --> 23:32.311
- I'm going to Popeyes right now.
- What?

23:32.311 --> 23:34.180
Wait. We still have
the main meal.

23:34.180 --> 23:35.682
Hey, do you know
what time it is?

23:35.682 --> 23:37.484
You know what time it is?
It is 2:55 p.m.

23:37.484 --> 23:39.151
That means, in five minutes,
that Popeyes across the street

23:39.151 --> 23:40.687
is gonna be filled
with goddamn high schoolers.

23:40.687 --> 23:42.354
And our only chance of getting
a goddamn chicken sandwich

23:42.354 --> 23:44.691
is gonna be goddamn next week,
so I'm out, goddamn it.

23:44.691 --> 23:46.659
- How was the bathroom, sir?
- Far, nigga. It was far.

23:46.659 --> 23:48.828
Well, uh, we have a surprise
for you guys today.

23:48.828 --> 23:50.697
It's the, uh, chef's special--

23:50.697 --> 23:52.999
a very rare delicacy,
especially here in Georgia.

23:52.999 --> 23:54.701
Blowfish cheek.

23:54.701 --> 23:56.168
And as you all have
probably heard,

23:56.168 --> 23:58.170
blowfish are extremely poisonous

23:58.170 --> 24:00.339
and must be cut
with a skilled hand.

24:00.339 --> 24:02.709
But Chef Kenny--
he studied with the finest,

24:02.709 --> 24:04.511
and Demarcus oversaw
the cutting himself.

24:04.511 --> 24:07.213
Itadakimasu.

24:11.250 --> 24:13.352
Yeah, I ain't doing that, man.

24:13.352 --> 24:15.354
- I'm sorry?
- I said I'm not doing it!

24:15.354 --> 24:17.456
All right, look, thank y'all
for your service and everything.

24:17.456 --> 24:18.891
The ambiance is beautiful,
the art is great,

24:18.891 --> 24:20.527
but we... we got to go.

24:20.527 --> 24:23.530
But, sir, the-the blowfish is
a rare delicacy. I can assure...

24:23.530 --> 24:25.464
Yeah, man. I'm sure it is.
I'm sure it is, but we got...

24:25.464 --> 24:27.634
I got a rap thing
that we got to go to, so, we...

24:27.634 --> 24:29.536
- We double-booked.
- Yeah, sorry about that.

24:29.536 --> 24:31.638
You're going to Popeyes.

24:31.638 --> 24:33.773
Aren't you?

24:35.041 --> 24:37.043
No, man. No.

24:37.043 --> 24:39.045
Yes, you are.

24:39.045 --> 24:41.480
They all do.

24:41.480 --> 24:43.716
Look, I don't know what
you're talking about, man.

24:43.716 --> 24:46.218
- We-we got to rap thing...
- You know,

24:46.218 --> 24:51.257
there's a movie theater
two blocks away from here.

24:51.257 --> 24:54.226
The night
Queen Slim premiered,

24:54.226 --> 24:56.563
we were filled.

24:56.563 --> 24:58.765
Line out the door.

24:58.765 --> 25:01.100
Black people hopped up

25:01.100 --> 25:04.637
on nationalism
coming to support their own.

25:05.938 --> 25:08.340
15 minutes later,

25:08.340 --> 25:10.743
we were empty.

25:12.411 --> 25:15.848
Not one person ate the blowfish.

25:15.848 --> 25:18.284
Not one.

25:18.284 --> 25:20.352
Just a bunch of Yelp reviews

25:20.352 --> 25:22.589
that all said the same thing.

25:22.589 --> 25:25.692
"This nigga serving
poison fish."

25:25.692 --> 25:27.694
- Hey, listen, man. I...
- Do you know

25:27.694 --> 25:31.964
the traditional way to make
sushi is with your bare hands?

25:32.932 --> 25:36.969
And that sushi should be served
at room temperature?

25:38.337 --> 25:40.807
Every Japanese sushi restaurant

25:40.807 --> 25:44.777
worth its soy sauce
does it that way,

25:44.777 --> 25:47.814
and no one seemed to notice.

25:47.814 --> 25:51.117
But if a brother

25:51.117 --> 25:56.623
from Alabama
does it the same way,

25:56.623 --> 25:58.991
suddenly, the fish is dirty.

25:58.991 --> 26:02.394
- Yeah, but y'all serving us...
- You know, in Japan,

26:02.394 --> 26:04.130
there's a sushi restaurant

26:04.130 --> 26:05.665
that can't even
take reservations

26:05.665 --> 26:08.835
from the general public
because it is so acclaimed?

26:08.835 --> 26:11.337
You want to know where it is?

26:11.337 --> 26:16.475
It's on the Ginza line
in a Tokyo subway station.

26:16.475 --> 26:18.477
I know because my master,

26:18.477 --> 26:21.213
Yuji Watanabe, studied there.

26:22.481 --> 26:24.483
You see, he taught me

26:24.483 --> 26:27.654
that it doesn't matter
where you serve the sushi.

26:27.654 --> 26:30.189
A subway,

26:30.189 --> 26:33.826
- an old Blockbuster Video.
- I knew it.

26:33.826 --> 26:35.995
It doesn't matter.

26:35.995 --> 26:40.432
He says, if the sushi's good,

26:40.432 --> 26:42.735
people will come.

26:45.337 --> 26:48.174
But I guess my master was never
a nigga from Florida.

26:48.174 --> 26:51.510
- Listen, brother man.
- Don't give me
that "brother" shit!

27:00.753 --> 27:02.889
This entire dinner,

27:02.889 --> 27:05.692
you have been staring
across the street

27:05.692 --> 27:07.727
at a modern-day Coon Chicken,

27:07.727 --> 27:11.864
served to you by an Aunt Jemima,

27:11.864 --> 27:14.033
who lies to you repeatedly,

27:14.033 --> 27:16.202
telling you it is her recipe

27:16.202 --> 27:19.038
and that she is benefiting
from it.

27:19.038 --> 27:21.473
It is not her recipe.

27:21.473 --> 27:24.210
You know who owns that recipe?

27:24.210 --> 27:28.214
An Italian man and his family,

27:28.214 --> 27:30.549
none of which
have married Black.

27:30.549 --> 27:35.054
I heard some of them even moved
from New Orleans to New Jersey.

27:36.889 --> 27:39.726
New... Jersey.

27:39.726 --> 27:41.728
All right, man.

27:41.728 --> 27:43.730
All right, I get it.

27:43.730 --> 27:45.397
Oh, you get it?

27:45.397 --> 27:47.599
Yeah. Yeah, I-I get it.

27:47.599 --> 27:50.269
- You get it now?
- I get it now, man.

27:51.270 --> 27:52.939
Then eat it.

28:00.412 --> 28:02.949
- What?
- Eat it.

28:02.949 --> 28:07.453
- Eat my poison fish, brother.
- Al...

28:09.922 --> 28:12.191
Oh, let me guess.

28:12.191 --> 28:14.526
You want some hot sauce
to go with it, brother?

28:20.099 --> 28:24.036
All right, man. All right,
uh, you made your point,

28:24.036 --> 28:26.105
- Demarcus, okay?
- Look outside.

28:32.344 --> 28:35.314
That's the future.

28:35.314 --> 28:37.316
That's our future.

28:38.350 --> 28:41.120
Salted and battered.

28:42.288 --> 28:45.724
Being sold back to us
in our own image.

28:47.326 --> 28:50.562
See, the problem with us is

28:50.562 --> 28:53.199
we don't trust each other.

28:55.868 --> 28:58.137
"Don't trust a Chicago nigga,

28:58.137 --> 29:01.173
they're shady."

29:01.173 --> 29:04.010
"Don't believe niggas
from New Orleans,

29:04.010 --> 29:06.212
they're slimy."

29:07.313 --> 29:10.249
"Gotta watch out
for them New York niggas.

29:10.249 --> 29:12.651
They're bound to hit a lick."

29:13.652 --> 29:17.824
We've been told time
and time again

29:17.824 --> 29:20.860
the only person you can trust...

29:26.365 --> 29:28.835
...is yourself.

29:28.835 --> 29:30.502
Right?

29:38.010 --> 29:39.946
Lock the doors.

29:39.946 --> 29:42.048
What?

29:45.384 --> 29:46.853
Darius?

29:46.853 --> 29:48.287
- Oh, shit!
- Ah!

29:48.287 --> 29:49.856
Get in my pink Maserati.
It's outside. Go, go, go, go!

29:49.856 --> 29:53.125
Hey, thanks again!

29:56.628 --> 29:59.198
Fight me! Fight me!

30:53.953 --> 30:55.354
Oh, shit.

30:55.354 --> 30:57.189
That was the best Popeyes

30:57.189 --> 30:59.591
- I've ever had in my life.
- It was good, right?

30:59.591 --> 31:01.860
Oh, my God, yo.

31:01.860 --> 31:03.930
Food tastes better when
you think you're about to die.

31:03.930 --> 31:06.465
Oh, my God, man,
that shit is so true.

31:06.465 --> 31:08.534
I was kind of scared, though.

31:08.534 --> 31:11.037
You know that this, technically,
is all your fault.

31:11.037 --> 31:12.939
I'm just playin'.

31:15.141 --> 31:18.277
Hey, D, where the fuck
you get that car from, man?

31:18.277 --> 31:21.280
I stole it.

31:21.280 --> 31:24.050
This nigga.

31:24.050 --> 31:27.319
- What you mean?
- What do you mean, man?

31:27.319 --> 31:30.522
I stole it from the valet. Yeah.

31:31.857 --> 31:33.225
- The...
- What?

31:33.225 --> 31:34.326
Nigga, you had us

31:34.326 --> 31:36.062
- in a stolen car?
- Are you serious?

31:36.062 --> 31:37.329
You can get in trouble for that.

31:37.329 --> 31:38.664
Nah, I'm not worried about
getting in trouble.

31:38.664 --> 31:40.132
I'm still in the tank.

31:42.034 --> 31:44.236
What?

31:44.236 --> 31:47.006
Darius, you're not in the tank.

31:47.006 --> 31:49.675
I am.

31:49.675 --> 31:52.011
No, you're not in the tank.

31:52.011 --> 31:55.147
You're really here,
and we're really your friends.

31:55.147 --> 31:57.984
Maybe it's just, uh,
my dream,

31:57.984 --> 32:01.087
and you are just in it.

32:01.087 --> 32:02.888
Always have been.

32:08.527 --> 32:10.696
Uh, well, okay.

32:10.696 --> 32:14.433
Um... hey, y'all wanna smoke
some of my weed?

32:14.433 --> 32:15.934
- Yeah.
- Yeah. Yeah, yeah, yeah.

32:15.934 --> 32:16.935
Yeah, let's do it, man.

32:16.935 --> 32:18.337
No better time than now.

32:18.337 --> 32:21.373
Don't worry, man,
it's gonna be fine.

32:21.373 --> 32:22.508
Ah, well...

32:22.508 --> 32:25.344
Just, I don't...

32:25.344 --> 32:28.380
Hey, look. Hey, you rollin'.

32:29.581 --> 32:31.383
- Whew.
- Do you know
how to roll one?

32:31.383 --> 32:34.020
Ah, she knows.
I'll meet you out there, man.

32:36.555 --> 32:38.024
- Hey, man.
- Huh?

32:38.024 --> 32:39.358
- You wanna come?
- Oh, yeah, I'm coming.
I'm coming.

32:39.358 --> 32:43.462
I will join you out there.
Just wait for me, sir.

32:43.462 --> 32:45.531
- All right, well...
- Yeah.

32:45.531 --> 32:47.133
- All right.
- Go.

32:47.133 --> 32:49.235
All right, man.

32:51.870 --> 32:53.372
- Oh, no.
- How long
is it gonna take?

32:53.372 --> 32:54.706
I don't even know, man.

32:54.706 --> 32:57.376
That's why I ain't even
part of that shit.

33:20.066 --> 33:21.567
...is to make a decision

33:21.567 --> 33:22.934
as to whether or not...

33:39.785 --> 33:45.691
There's a song that I sing ♪

33:45.691 --> 33:49.027
Whenever I'm sad ♪

33:49.027 --> 33:51.930
Feeling bad ♪

33:51.930 --> 33:58.270
There's a place in my head ♪

33:58.270 --> 34:04.310
♪ That I go
when I'm feeling low ♪

34:08.614 --> 34:11.650
I can trust in the melody ♪

34:11.650 --> 34:14.886
In the song I can find me ♪

34:14.886 --> 34:19.958
♪ Ever since I lost you,
I've been so lost, too ♪

34:19.958 --> 34:23.329
In our love there is harmony ♪

34:23.329 --> 34:28.134
♪ And I want to see
this love through with you ♪

34:30.702 --> 34:36.675
There is a song you can sing ♪

34:36.675 --> 34:39.511
There's a quiet place ♪

34:39.511 --> 34:42.148
All you got to do is space ♪

34:42.148 --> 34:45.351
There's a song ♪

34:45.351 --> 34:48.154
That I sing ♪

34:48.154 --> 34:51.323
Whenever I'm sad ♪

34:51.323 --> 34:54.360
Feeling bad. ♪

35:03.502 --> 35:05.571
Captioned by
Media Access Group at WGBH access.wgbh.org
